```

```diff
diff --git a/tests/README_guard.py b/tests/README_guard.py
new file mode 100644
+import pathlib
+
+def validate_readme():
+    for folder in pathlib.Path(".").iterdir():
+        if folder.name.startswith("."):
+            continue
+        if folder.name == "docker":
+            continue
+        readme_path = folder / "README.md"
+        if not readme_path.exists():
+            print(f"Missing README in {folder}")
+
+if __name__ == "__main__":
+    validate_readme()
```

The GitHub workflow `check-readmes` job still used a shell README check in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`; this bundle records the local guard script behavior separately from historical CI.
